[{"text": "Hello, English learners. Welcome back to EnglishPod. My name is Marco.", "start": 1.1399999999999997, "end": 4.58}, {"text": "And I'm Erika.", "start": 4.78, "end": 5.58}, {"text": "And today we're bringing you the third part of this series that we've created called I'm Sorry, I Love You.", "start": 5.96, "end": 11.82}, {"text": "That's right. The third part in our story about our EnglishPod couple.", "start": 11.96, "end": 16.08}, {"text": "Yeah, it's a romantic series, but today we're bringing you an argument.", "start": 16.4, "end": 19.4}, {"text": "That's right.", "start": 19.76, "end": 20.32}, {"text": "Like in every relationship, you have fights, you have discussions.", "start": 20.64, "end": 23.5}, {"text": "So we're going to teach you how to do that in English.", "start": 23.8, "end": 25.86}, {"text": "That's right. In today's lesson, you'll learn some great language that people use when they get into an argument with their boyfriend or girlfriend.", "start": 25.86, "end": 35.08}, {"text": "Right. So why don't we take a look at vocabulary preview?", "start": 35.4, "end": 37.54}, {"text": "Vocabulary preview.", "start": 38.14, "end": 39.38}, {"text": "We have one phrase today.", "start": 39.64, "end": 41.4}, {"text": "Get a hold.", "start": 42.1, "end": 43.44}, {"text": "Get a hold.", "start": 43.78, "end": 44.66}, {"text": "Get a hold.", "start": 44.8, "end": 45.42}, {"text": "To get a hold.", "start": 45.8, "end": 47.16}, {"text": "To get a hold of someone means...", "start": 47.4, "end": 49.64}, {"text": "To try and communicate with that person.", "start": 49.64, "end": 52.48}, {"text": "Exactly. So to try and call that person.", "start": 52.74, "end": 55.66}, {"text": "For example, I can say,", "start": 55.86, "end": 57.34}, {"text": "I've been calling his phone all day, but I can't get a hold of him.", "start": 57.980000000000004, "end": 61.7}, {"text": "Or I could say,", "start": 62.22, "end": 63.24}, {"text": "Finally, Marco, I got a hold of you.", "start": 63.54, "end": 65.42}, {"text": "Where have you been all day?", "start": 65.52, "end": 66.64}, {"text": "Exactly.", "start": 66.96, "end": 67.32}, {"text": "Now we're going to listen to our dialogue.", "start": 68.08, "end": 69.64}, {"text": "And as always, it's going to be at a normal pace, but you don't have to worry about it.", "start": 69.64, "end": 72.94}, {"text": "We'll come back and teach you all of the important words.", "start": 73.08, "end": 76.26}, {"text": "Stephen, where have you been?", "start": 86.08, "end": 88.04}, {"text": "I've been trying to get a hold of you for hours.", "start": 88.36, "end": 90.98}, {"text": "I, uh, there was an emergency at work, so...", "start": 91.48, "end": 94.4}, {"text": "I was waiting for you in the restaurant for three hours.", "start": 94.4, "end": 97.06}, {"text": "And you didn't even have the decency to call me.", "start": 97.38, "end": 100.42}, {"text": "Do you have any idea how embarrassed I was?", "start": 100.42, "end": 103.7}, {"text": "Honey, I promise this won't happen again.", "start": 103.96, "end": 106.44}, {"text": "It's just that I...", "start": 106.64, "end": 107.72}, {"text": "Yeah, right.", "start": 107.72, "end": 108.16}, {"text": "I've heard it all before.", "start": 108.46, "end": 109.84}, {"text": "I'm not going to take any more of your empty promises.", "start": 110.16, "end": 113.02}, {"text": "This is the fifth time you stood me up in two weeks.", "start": 113.34, "end": 116.66}, {"text": "You need to get your priorities straight.", "start": 117.06, "end": 118.86}, {"text": "I'm tired of you putting your job first all the time.", "start": 119.2, "end": 121.94}, {"text": "Come on, Veronica.", "start": 122.66, "end": 123.66}, {"text": "That's not fair.", "start": 123.92, "end": 124.66}, {"text": "I do care about you a lot.", "start": 125.16, "end": 126.66}, {"text": "You know that.", "start": 126.76, "end": 127.24}, {"text": "I try to...", "start": 127.52, "end": 128.7}, {"text": "You know what?", "start": 128.7, "end": 128.92}, {"text": "Maybe we should just take a break.", "start": 129.32, "end": 130.94}, {"text": "I need some time to think about where this relationship is heading.", "start": 131.18, "end": 134.32}, {"text": "But, Veronica, would you listen to me?", "start": 134.64, "end": 136.64}, {"text": "There was a fire alarm at my office building today, and I was...", "start": 136.86, "end": 140.38}, {"text": "Okay, so a little bit of trouble in the relationship.", "start": 147.82, "end": 150.16}, {"text": "Yeah, that's too bad.", "start": 150.16, "end": 152.1}, {"text": "Yeah, well, I think she's overreacting.", "start": 152.52, "end": 155.38}, {"text": "You do?", "start": 155.62, "end": 156.04}, {"text": "We'll talk about that later on.", "start": 156.8, "end": 158.8}, {"text": "But we saw some great words and phrases here, so it's time for Language Takeaway.", "start": 158.9, "end": 163.78}, {"text": "Language Takeaway", "start": 165.92000000000002, "end": 167.12}, {"text": "Today on Language Takeaway, we're bringing you three words.", "start": 168.14000000000001, "end": 170.86}, {"text": "The first word is stood me up.", "start": 171.2, "end": 174.16}, {"text": "Stood me up.", "start": 174.66, "end": 175.96}, {"text": "Stood me up.", "start": 176.14, "end": 177.56}, {"text": "Stood me up.", "start": 177.94, "end": 179.1}, {"text": "The phrase stand someone up.", "start": 179.1, "end": 181.28}, {"text": "When do we use this?", "start": 181.38, "end": 182.42}, {"text": "If, for example, you have a date and you don't go.", "start": 182.96, "end": 185.96}, {"text": "Okay, so let's say you and I were supposed to have dinner together, and you just didn't come.", "start": 186.5, "end": 192.56}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 192.74, "end": 192.88}, {"text": "And didn't call.", "start": 193.02, "end": 193.58}, {"text": "Right, so I stood you up.", "start": 193.82, "end": 195.72}, {"text": "Yeah, okay.", "start": 195.86, "end": 196.62}, {"text": "Stand someone up.", "start": 196.96, "end": 197.78}, {"text": "Our next word, priorities.", "start": 197.92, "end": 200.16}, {"text": "Priorities.", "start": 201.54, "end": 202.06}, {"text": "Priorities.", "start": 202.38, "end": 202.9}, {"text": "So, priorities are something that's really important in your life.", "start": 202.9, "end": 206.56}, {"text": "That's right.", "start": 206.7, "end": 207.2}, {"text": "Like family, or maybe work, or making a lot of money, or whatever it is.", "start": 207.32, "end": 212.76}, {"text": "What are your priorities in life, right?", "start": 212.84, "end": 214.68}, {"text": "Right, yeah.", "start": 214.7, "end": 215.32}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 215.6, "end": 215.88}, {"text": "And our last word for Language Takeaway, heading.", "start": 216.34, "end": 219.28}, {"text": "Heading.", "start": 219.58, "end": 220.14}, {"text": "Heading.", "start": 220.72, "end": 221.28}, {"text": "Heading.", "start": 221.52, "end": 222.0}, {"text": "This is a bit of a funny verb, so let's listen to a couple of examples of how it's used so", "start": 222.0, "end": 228.62}, {"text": "we can understand its meaning.", "start": 228.62, "end": 230.18}, {"text": "Example one.", "start": 231.84, "end": 232.76}, {"text": "I don't know where our relationship is heading.", "start": 235.6, "end": 238.08}, {"text": "Example two.", "start": 242.22, "end": 243.12}, {"text": "Where's this bus heading?", "start": 245.64000000000001, "end": 246.78}, {"text": "Example three.", "start": 250.22, "end": 251.2}, {"text": "Where is this project heading?", "start": 253.5, "end": 255.16}, {"text": "So, basically, heading means going.", "start": 257.8, "end": 259.72}, {"text": "Exactly.", "start": 260.38, "end": 260.74}, {"text": "A heading is where you're going.", "start": 261.06, "end": 262.54}, {"text": "Yep.", "start": 262.74, "end": 262.88}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 263.48, "end": 263.84}, {"text": "Easy word.", "start": 264.06, "end": 264.62}, {"text": "Interesting.", "start": 264.82, "end": 265.1}, {"text": "Okay, so now it's time for us to listen to the dialogue a second time.", "start": 265.98, "end": 269.5}, {"text": "It's going to be slower, so now we can understand the words that we just talked about.", "start": 269.82, "end": 272.9}, {"text": "Stephen.", "start": 279.88, "end": 280.34}, {"text": "Stephen.", "start": 280.34, "end": 280.48}, {"text": "Where have you been?", "start": 280.88, "end": 282.44}, {"text": "I've been trying to get a hold of you for hours.", "start": 283.04, "end": 286.46}, {"text": "I...", "start": 287.64, "end": 288.28}, {"text": "Um...", "start": 288.28, "end": 289.46}, {"text": "There was an emergency at work, so...", "start": 289.46, "end": 292.5}, {"text": "I was waiting for you in the restaurant for three hours, and you didn't even have the decency", "start": 292.5, "end": 297.88}, {"text": "to call me.", "start": 297.88, "end": 298.64}, {"text": "Do you have any idea how embarrassed I was?", "start": 298.86, "end": 302.3}, {"text": "Honey, I promise this won't happen again.", "start": 302.3, "end": 305.84}, {"text": "It's just that I...", "start": 306.24, "end": 307.7}, {"text": "Yeah, right.", "start": 307.7, "end": 308.24}, {"text": "I've heard it all before.", "start": 308.54, "end": 309.88}, {"text": "I'm not going to take any more of your empty promises.", "start": 310.12, "end": 314.4}, {"text": "This is the fifth time you've stood me up in two weeks.", "start": 314.4, "end": 319.48}, {"text": "You need to get your priorities straight.", "start": 319.48, "end": 322.64}, {"text": "I'm tired of you putting your job first all the time.", "start": 322.64, "end": 327.54}, {"text": "Come on, Veronica.", "start": 327.54, "end": 329.36}, {"text": "That's not fair.", "start": 329.64, "end": 330.46}, {"text": "I do care about you.", "start": 330.86, "end": 332.62}, {"text": "A lot.", "start": 332.76, "end": 333.3}, {"text": "You know that.", "start": 333.52, "end": 334.44}, {"text": "I tried.", "start": 334.74, "end": 335.96}, {"text": "You know what?", "start": 336.3, "end": 337.46}, {"text": "Maybe we should just take a break.", "start": 338.22, "end": 341.1}, {"text": "I need some time to think about where this relationship is heading.", "start": 341.72, "end": 346.62}, {"text": "But, Veronica, would you just listen to me?", "start": 346.98, "end": 350.66}, {"text": "There was a fire alarm at my office building today, and I was stuck...", "start": 350.86, "end": 356.1}, {"text": "Okay, now we saw some interesting phrases in dialogue.", "start": 359.88, "end": 362.78}, {"text": "Yeah, we saw some great phrases that people use when they're getting in a fight.", "start": 363.02, "end": 367.28}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 367.6, "end": 368.02}, {"text": "Why don't we take a look at some of them in Fluency Builder?", "start": 368.3, "end": 371.08}, {"text": "Fluency Builder.", "start": 372.04, "end": 373.12}, {"text": "The first phrase that I want to take a look at today is, do you have any idea?", "start": 373.2, "end": 378.22}, {"text": "Do you have any idea?", "start": 378.44, "end": 379.54}, {"text": "Do you have any idea?", "start": 379.88, "end": 381.4}, {"text": "This is a great way to set up an argument.", "start": 381.68, "end": 384.36}, {"text": "So, let's listen to some examples of how you would set up an argument using this phrase.", "start": 385.02, "end": 389.58}, {"text": "Example 1.", "start": 390.5, "end": 391.42}, {"text": "You forgot my birthday.", "start": 393.46, "end": 394.86}, {"text": "Do you have any idea how angry I am?", "start": 395.22, "end": 397.52}, {"text": "Example 2.", "start": 400.12, "end": 401.28}, {"text": "Julie kissed my boyfriend.", "start": 403.3, "end": 405.18}, {"text": "Does she have any idea how mean that was?", "start": 405.18, "end": 408.9}, {"text": "Example 3.", "start": 412.3, "end": 413.48}, {"text": "I just broke up with my boyfriend.", "start": 416.08000000000004, "end": 418.16}, {"text": "Don't you have any idea how sad I am?", "start": 418.6, "end": 421.62}, {"text": "So, it's a great phrase to make that person understand that you were really worried or...", "start": 423.88, "end": 428.18}, {"text": "Really angry.", "start": 428.18, "end": 428.88}, {"text": "Really angry.", "start": 429.22, "end": 429.44}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 429.6, "end": 429.78}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 430.06, "end": 430.14}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 430.28, "end": 430.5}, {"text": "And now the second phrase that we can take a look at is, I've heard it all before.", "start": 430.86, "end": 434.44}, {"text": "I heard it all before.", "start": 434.44, "end": 436.34}, {"text": "I've heard it all before.", "start": 436.66, "end": 438.12}, {"text": "I've heard it all before.", "start": 438.38, "end": 439.7}, {"text": "So, this is a great phrase of just saying, you don't have to give me an excuse.", "start": 440.1, "end": 443.68}, {"text": "I know what you're going to say.", "start": 443.68, "end": 445.0}, {"text": "Exactly.", "start": 445.28, "end": 445.74}, {"text": "And our last phrase today, take a break.", "start": 446.24, "end": 448.72}, {"text": "Take a break.", "start": 449.02, "end": 449.92}, {"text": "Take a break.", "start": 450.18, "end": 451.16}, {"text": "So, when a couple takes a break, they sort of stop their relationship, right?", "start": 451.44, "end": 457.48}, {"text": "They're breaking up.", "start": 457.48, "end": 458.46}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 458.7, "end": 458.84}, {"text": "But is it really like forever?", "start": 458.98, "end": 460.78}, {"text": "Like a breakup that lasts forever?", "start": 461.12, "end": 462.94}, {"text": "Not...", "start": 463.34, "end": 463.76}, {"text": "Well, maybe.", "start": 463.76, "end": 464.3}, {"text": "It could be forever.", "start": 464.58, "end": 465.62}, {"text": "But they're saying, let's just take some time away from each other for a couple of days", "start": 465.62, "end": 470.98}, {"text": "or weeks.", "start": 470.98, "end": 471.46}, {"text": "Yeah, yeah.", "start": 471.66, "end": 471.94}, {"text": "And see what happens.", "start": 472.1, "end": 473.0}, {"text": "Yes.", "start": 473.28, "end": 473.48}, {"text": "Take a break.", "start": 473.84, "end": 474.52}, {"text": "Take a break.", "start": 474.68, "end": 475.18}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 475.88, "end": 476.36}, {"text": "So, our happy couple is going to take a break.", "start": 476.38, "end": 479.26}, {"text": "Well, I guess they're not that happy then, right?", "start": 479.56, "end": 481.36}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 481.36, "end": 481.6}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 482.8, "end": 483.28}, {"text": "So, let's listen to our dialogue again, and then we'll come back and talk some more.", "start": 483.32, "end": 487.3}, {"text": "Stephen, where have you been?", "start": 496.28, "end": 498.3}, {"text": "I've been trying to get a hold of you for hours.", "start": 498.56, "end": 501.24}, {"text": "I, uh, there was an emergency at work, so...", "start": 501.74, "end": 504.88}, {"text": "I was waiting for you in the restaurant for three hours, and you didn't even have the decency", "start": 504.88, "end": 509.84}, {"text": "to call me.", "start": 509.84, "end": 510.7}, {"text": "Do you have any idea how embarrassed I was?", "start": 511.02, "end": 513.96}, {"text": "Honey, I promise this won't happen again.", "start": 514.18, "end": 516.72}, {"text": "It's just that I...", "start": 516.72, "end": 517.96}, {"text": "Yeah, right.", "start": 517.96, "end": 518.42}, {"text": "I've heard it all before.", "start": 518.76, "end": 520.12}, {"text": "I'm not going to take any more of your empty promises.", "start": 520.46, "end": 523.3}, {"text": "This is the fifth time you stood me up in two weeks.", "start": 523.68, "end": 526.92}, {"text": "You need to get your priorities straight.", "start": 527.26, "end": 529.14}, {"text": "I'm tired of you putting your job first all the time.", "start": 529.54, "end": 532.2}, {"text": "Come on, Veronica.", "start": 532.94, "end": 533.94}, {"text": "That's not fair.", "start": 534.18, "end": 534.92}, {"text": "I do care about you a lot.", "start": 535.42, "end": 536.94}, {"text": "You know that.", "start": 537.02, "end": 537.5}, {"text": "I try to...", "start": 537.72, "end": 538.68}, {"text": "You know what?", "start": 538.68, "end": 539.16}, {"text": "Maybe we should just take a break.", "start": 539.56, "end": 541.18}, {"text": "I need some time to think about where this relationship is heading.", "start": 541.44, "end": 544.58}, {"text": "But, Veronica, would you listen to me?", "start": 544.92, "end": 546.9}, {"text": "There was a fire alarm at my office building today, and I was...", "start": 547.12, "end": 550.64}, {"text": "So, Marco, this phrase, to take a break, really reminds me of a Friends episode.", "start": 557.0, "end": 562.98}, {"text": "Yeah, that really famous Friends episode when Ross and Rachel were on a break.", "start": 563.26, "end": 567.66}, {"text": "And Ross, like, went with another girl, right?", "start": 568.12, "end": 570.58}, {"text": "Yeah, yeah.", "start": 570.58, "end": 570.8}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 570.9, "end": 571.16}, {"text": "And then they definitely broke up after that.", "start": 571.3, "end": 573.2}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 573.32, "end": 573.58}, {"text": "So, that's one of the key issues, right?", "start": 573.58, "end": 576.36}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 576.48, "end": 576.62}, {"text": "If you're taking a break, can you start to date someone else?", "start": 576.72, "end": 579.78}, {"text": "I've got to agree with Rachel.", "start": 580.3, "end": 581.72}, {"text": "Really?", "start": 581.98, "end": 582.42}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 582.62, "end": 582.86}, {"text": "No, you can't.", "start": 583.06, "end": 583.9}, {"text": "You can't.", "start": 583.96, "end": 584.54}, {"text": "So, what's the point of taking a break?", "start": 584.72, "end": 586.44}, {"text": "Just, you need some time away.", "start": 586.62, "end": 588.06}, {"text": "You need some time to think.", "start": 588.06, "end": 589.48}, {"text": "But you're not really broken up.", "start": 589.72, "end": 591.38}, {"text": "Exactly.", "start": 591.78, "end": 592.22}, {"text": "That's convenient.", "start": 593.22, "end": 594.1}, {"text": "I don't know.", "start": 594.42, "end": 595.14}, {"text": "They were on a break.", "start": 595.46, "end": 596.26}, {"text": "I agree with Ross.", "start": 596.26, "end": 597.08}, {"text": "Well, you would, wouldn't you?", "start": 597.32, "end": 598.76}, {"text": "All right, guys.", "start": 599.48, "end": 600.34}, {"text": "We're out of time today.", "start": 600.34, "end": 601.24}, {"text": "I hope you enjoyed our lesson.", "start": 601.32, "end": 602.42}, {"text": "And be sure to listen next time because we will definitely have a part four to this.", "start": 602.42, "end": 607.28}, {"text": "Yes.", "start": 607.46, "end": 607.94}, {"text": "Coming out soon.", "start": 608.08, "end": 608.7}, {"text": "Yep.", "start": 608.86, "end": 608.98}, {"text": "And also, come to our website at EnglishPod.com and leave all your questions and comments.", "start": 609.34, "end": 613.68}, {"text": "Yeah, Marco and I are always happy to hear from you and we love answering your questions.", "start": 614.12, "end": 618.22}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 618.58, "end": 618.96}, {"text": "And maybe you can tell us what you think happens in the fourth part.", "start": 618.96, "end": 621.96}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 622.2, "end": 622.46}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 622.92, "end": 623.2}, {"text": "Well, until then, it's...", "start": 623.6, "end": 624.9}, {"text": "Goodbye.", "start": 624.9, "end": 625.16}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 625.42, "end": 625.56}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 625.92, "end": 626.22}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 627.32, "end": 627.8}, {"text": "", "start": 628.08, "end": 628.08}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 628.26, "end": 628.74}, {"text": "", "start": 628.74,